invariant: INV-7
file: srv_flight.c
catches: srv_flight_test_aes_runtime
reason: an AES=runtime server whose caller's probe found no AES instructions
  takes a second ClientHello whose cookie holds it to AES-128-GCM, which
  a server with the instructions minted under the same cookie key. The
  session then keys AES-GCM traffic on a CPU its caller said lacks the
  instructions. test_flight_without_aes requires that retry to fail with
  illegal_parameter under the absent answer and to open under the present
  one.

--- old
    if (!suite_runs_here(&h->t->cfg, suite)) {
--- new
    if (!suite_runs_here(&h->t->cfg, SUITE_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256)) {
